IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. EXAMPLE-PROG.
AUTHOR. RADU ZAHARIA.
INSTALLATION. RADU-MAC-MINI.
DATE-WRITTEN. 10/27/2026.
SECURITY. CONFIDENTIAL.

ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
INPUT-OUTPUT SECTION.
FILE-CONTROL.
    SELECT EMPLOYEE-FILE ASSIGN TO "employee.dat"
        ORGANIZATION IS INDEXED
        ACCESS MODE IS RANDOM
        RECORD KEY IS FILE-EMP-ID.

DATA DIVISION.
FILE SECTION.
FD EMPLOYEE-FILE.
01 EMPLOYEE-FILE-RECORD.
   05 FILE-EMP-ID   PIC 9(5).
   05 FILE-EMP-NAME PIC X(30).

WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
01 EMPLOYEE-RECORD.
   05 EMP-ID     PIC 9(5).
   05 EMP-NAME   PIC X(30).

PROCEDURE DIVISION.
MAIN-LOGIC.
    DISPLAY 'Starting the program...'.
    PERFORM DO-SOMETHING-USEFUL.
    DISPLAY 'Ending the program.'.
    STOP RUN.

DO-SOMETHING-USEFUL.
    DISPLAY 'Inside a paragraph (like a mini-subroutine).'.

    OPEN OUTPUT EMPLOYEE-FILE

    MOVE 10425 TO FILE-EMP-ID
    MOVE 'Jane Doe' TO FILE-EMP-NAME

    WRITE EMPLOYEE-FILE-RECORD
        INVALID KEY 
            DISPLAY 'Error: Could not write record (Duplicate ID?)'
        NOT INVALID KEY 
            DISPLAY 'Success! Employee written to database.'
    END-WRITE

    CLOSE EMPLOYEE-FILE.
